# Working copies, not settings. `.claude/` itself is shared — project
# settings, commands and agents belong in the repository — but a worktree
# under it is a checkout of this repository inside itself, and `git add -A`
# stages one as an embedded repository rather than ignoring it.
.claude/worktrees/
